generation.user_prompt_template:
Create the content for a product listing page.

TARGET KEYWORD: {keyword}
PARSED INTENT: {intent_json}
PRODUCTS ON THIS PAGE (the only products you may reference):
{products_json}

LOCALE CONTEXT:
{locale_context}

BRAND: {brand_name}
BRAND TONE: {brand_tone}
COMPETITORS (positioning reference only — differentiate from them, never copy or mention them): {competitor_urls}

RELATED PAGES ON THIS SITE (for topical awareness only — do not write links):
{related_pages_json}

Requirements:
- h1: must contain the target keyword's meaning exactly and naturally (localized), unique to this style × room combination.
- intro: a single string (not an array) containing 2–3 paragraphs separated by blank lines. The first 100 words must state unambiguously what this page is: which style, which room, and what the visitor can buy here. Reference the actual character of the product range (dominant colours, pattern scales, materials visible in the product data).
- sections: exactly {section_count} sections. Headings must expand topical coverage around the style × room combination — pattern scale for the room's typical dimensions, colour and light, pairing with furniture and textiles, application advice for that room's conditions. Headings must NOT restate the h1. Bodies must cite specific products from the list by name where it strengthens the advice.
- faq: exactly {faq_count} question/answer pairs. Each answer must be fully self-contained and standalone — an AI assistant must be able to quote a single answer with zero surrounding context and it still makes complete sense (restate the subject in the answer; never write "as mentioned above" or bare "Yes/No" openers). Answer real purchase-intent questions for this specific combination (durability, light, sample ordering, quantities in the locale's measurement system).
- meta.title: max 60 characters, written for click-through in search results, front-load the keyword. This is a separate objective from the body copy — optimise for the SERP, not for elegance.
- meta.description: 120–155 characters, click-through focused, include a concrete reason to choose this page (range breadth, expertise, samples).
- product_alt_texts: one entry per product with exactly two keys — product_id (copy the product's id field verbatim) and alt_text describing the image as it serves THIS page's intent (style, colourway, room context), not a restatement of the product title.

Return only the JSON object.
